  "findings": "Dedicated branching green broom shoots with tiny basal trifoliate foliage and yellow pea-flower marks distributed along twigs replace the incorrect pink terminal rings. 1.0-2.4 m forms range upright to spreading. Pea petal structure is simplified at 25 mm. Actually reviewed botanical photos, current seeds 1,4,7 and all 36 variants. Accepted spring source; user endorsement remains separate.",
